WEBVTT

01:32.480 --> 01:34.720
That is the essence of Shu brocade.

01:34.800 --> 01:37.360
As the head of the Zhao family
and the Brocade Master of Yizhou,

01:37.440 --> 01:39.800
how could you use such an important item
to trade with him?

01:42.120 --> 01:43.320
For me,

01:44.440 --> 01:46.000
there are more important people
to protect.

01:49.160 --> 01:50.000
Yang Juli,

01:51.000 --> 01:52.320
under both family discipline
and state law,

01:53.040 --> 01:54.440
your crimes are unforgivable.

01:57.480 --> 01:58.600
Deal with him
under family discipline first!

01:58.680 --> 02:00.040
- Yes.
- Then hand him over to the authorities!

02:00.640 --> 02:02.040
Ms. Ji, you went back on your word!

02:02.120 --> 02:04.040
I… I already confessed.

02:04.120 --> 02:05.760
Why are you still hitting me?

02:05.840 --> 02:07.320
Stop!

02:08.199 --> 02:09.039
A traitor like you,

02:09.120 --> 02:10.919
worse than an animal!

02:11.000 --> 02:12.160
Are you even human?

02:12.240 --> 02:13.720
Are you worthy
of the Yang family ancestors?

02:13.800 --> 02:15.000
- Hit him!
- Hit him hard!

02:15.080 --> 02:16.720
- Hit him!
- Hit him!

02:34.680 --> 02:36.240
When did this all

02:37.480 --> 02:38.840
begin to change?

02:51.480 --> 02:52.600
Sir.

02:52.680 --> 02:54.680
Everything related to Bai Sheng,

02:54.760 --> 02:56.400
except for what was taken
by the Brocade Bureau,

02:56.480 --> 02:58.800
has disappeared without a trace.

02:59.720 --> 03:00.840
Perhaps,

03:00.920 --> 03:02.640
we should inquire with General Niu.

03:04.640 --> 03:06.040
He didn't tell me anything.

03:06.920 --> 03:07.920
That means

03:09.360 --> 03:10.880
he doesn't want me to interfere.

03:13.840 --> 03:15.200
Notify everyone.

03:15.280 --> 03:18.120
Make sure to closely guard the weavers
and the patterns,

03:18.640 --> 03:21.160
and be extra cautious these days.

03:22.720 --> 03:23.760
Yes, sir.

03:25.320 --> 03:26.320
Anything else?

03:28.040 --> 03:30.240
Ms. Niu hasn't eaten for five days.

03:31.680 --> 03:33.000
She insists on seeing you.

03:34.120 --> 03:35.600
I'm afraid

03:36.320 --> 03:38.000
that if anything happens to her,

03:38.080 --> 03:39.560
you won't be able to explain it
to the Niu family.

03:40.440 --> 03:44.440
YUAN

03:56.720 --> 03:57.560
Yu Yuan,

03:58.080 --> 03:58.920
look.

04:00.000 --> 04:02.040
Isn't this version written better?

04:03.200 --> 04:06.440
Father had a famous teacher instruct me
in calligraphy,

04:06.520 --> 04:07.720
but he said my writing

04:07.800 --> 04:09.840
is only fit for ledgers or letters,

04:09.920 --> 04:11.360
not for public view.

04:12.120 --> 04:13.600
Isn't that odd?

04:15.080 --> 04:16.000
Why are you looking for me?

04:19.440 --> 04:20.440
Yu Yuan,

04:20.519 --> 04:22.960
go brew a good pot of tea for Mr. Zhao.

04:23.680 --> 04:25.160
What do you want from me?

04:25.680 --> 04:27.000
Just say it.

04:31.080 --> 04:34.120
In a few days, it's my mother's birthday.

04:34.920 --> 04:37.440
Can I take Yu Yuan back to see her?

04:41.080 --> 04:42.440
I won't go to the front yard.

04:42.520 --> 04:44.560
I'll just watch from the attic.

04:47.320 --> 04:49.240
You can tie me up if you must.

04:51.080 --> 04:52.960
I beg you to allow it.

04:57.160 --> 04:58.200
Fine.

05:12.840 --> 05:13.840
See?

05:14.680 --> 05:16.680
I told you he would agree.

05:18.880 --> 05:20.320
In me,

05:20.840 --> 05:22.440
he sees another version of himself,

05:22.520 --> 05:24.520
one who has nothing.

05:28.240 --> 05:30.440
How could one not feel sorry
for themselves?

05:41.200 --> 05:42.120
Yu Yuan,

05:43.960 --> 05:46.320
I will make them all pay.

06:19.800 --> 06:21.680
I already know

06:22.560 --> 06:23.920
Yang Juli's matter.

06:25.560 --> 06:27.280
I have also made a decision

06:27.800 --> 06:29.040
according to the family rules.

06:33.880 --> 06:35.200
He is to be expelled

06:36.760 --> 06:38.520
from the Yang family genealogy

06:39.600 --> 06:41.480
and handed over to the authorities.

06:45.240 --> 06:47.880
In addition to colluding with outsiders
to harm me,

06:50.080 --> 06:51.480
he confessed

06:53.440 --> 06:55.200
how he corrupted family members

06:59.440 --> 07:00.800
to line his own pockets.

07:03.280 --> 07:04.840
But Yingying persuaded me,

07:07.600 --> 07:09.600
saying this isn't the fault
of the family members.

07:12.360 --> 07:13.640
It's because Yang Juli

07:14.880 --> 07:17.520
used family rules to manipulate everyone.

07:20.080 --> 07:20.920
Yingying,

07:23.040 --> 07:25.040
repeat what you told me

07:26.160 --> 07:28.160
to everyone here.

07:29.240 --> 07:30.080
Yes.

07:34.680 --> 07:36.800
Setting rules is meant to ensure

07:36.880 --> 07:38.600
that we act within bounds.

07:38.680 --> 07:41.360
The family rules established a century ago

07:41.440 --> 07:42.960
did indeed bring prosperity
to the Yang family.

07:44.080 --> 07:45.320
But a century has passed,

07:45.400 --> 07:47.880
and some rules are no longer suitable.

07:47.960 --> 07:49.480
Instead,

07:49.560 --> 07:52.120
they have become obstacles
hindering the Yang family's progress.

07:53.600 --> 07:54.960
I believe that today,

07:55.040 --> 07:58.360
instead of pursuing blame or punishment,

07:58.880 --> 08:00.880
it's better to address the root cause

08:00.960 --> 08:02.400
and implement new rules.

08:10.240 --> 08:11.400
What do you all think?

08:15.160 --> 08:16.440
Should we seek accountability,

08:17.880 --> 08:19.400
or should we reform?

08:20.240 --> 08:21.080
Reform.

08:21.160 --> 08:22.920
Of course, reform is the better choice.

08:23.000 --> 08:23.840
- Reform.
- Reform.

08:23.920 --> 08:24.760
- Reform.
- Reform.

08:24.840 --> 08:25.720
Good.

08:26.520 --> 08:27.680
Then, let's proceed with reform.

08:40.520 --> 08:42.080
I have just recovered
from a serious illness,

08:44.360 --> 08:45.440
and though I am willing,

08:45.520 --> 08:47.320
I lack the strength to lead the reforms.

08:53.120 --> 08:54.560
Thus, I ask Yingying

08:55.080 --> 08:56.600
to manage the Yang family's affairs,

08:59.840 --> 09:03.560
assisting Jingshan
in reforming the family's outdated rules

09:04.760 --> 09:06.600
to restore the family's integrity.

09:07.720 --> 09:10.280
Does anyone object?

09:14.160 --> 09:16.880
- We'll follow Ms. Ji's lead.
- We'll follow Ms. Ji's lead.

09:21.080 --> 09:21.920
Yingying.

09:30.800 --> 09:31.960
From today onwards,

09:32.760 --> 09:35.000
the Yang family entrusts you
with managing its affairs,

09:36.400 --> 09:38.040
rectifying its values,

09:38.120 --> 09:39.720
and reforming its trade practices

09:41.400 --> 09:43.400
to smooth the path of the family business.

09:43.480 --> 09:45.240
Act with caution,

09:45.760 --> 09:47.760
and take the Yang family's rise and fall
as your responsibility.

09:48.480 --> 09:50.880
Do not fail the expectations
of the Yang family members.

09:52.840 --> 09:55.280
I will follow your teachings.

10:22.280 --> 10:23.440
This is the Yang family's

10:23.960 --> 10:25.400
business seal.

10:26.840 --> 10:27.800
Take good care of it.

10:29.160 --> 10:30.040
Understood.

10:50.160 --> 10:52.240
- Greetings to Ms. Ji!
- Greetings to Ms. Ji!

11:39.680 --> 11:41.760
Do you still remember this place?

11:43.840 --> 11:45.000
Back then,

11:45.080 --> 11:47.440
I thought I had grasped your entire life
in my hands.

11:48.760 --> 11:49.840
Little did I know

11:50.640 --> 11:52.320
that I had also buried

11:52.880 --> 11:54.480
my own life here.

12:02.960 --> 12:05.120
I thought you were my pawn,

12:06.880 --> 12:07.840
but in the end,

12:08.360 --> 12:11.680
we're both at the mercy
of this unpredictable world.

12:17.920 --> 12:19.760
Do you know why I chose you?

12:27.320 --> 12:28.800
Because you were suitable,

12:30.880 --> 12:32.800
and because Ji Yingying valued you.

12:35.480 --> 12:36.960
Someone she values

12:38.040 --> 12:39.360
could not be wrong.

12:45.560 --> 12:47.840
Though Yingying and I are different,

12:49.240 --> 12:50.080
we share

12:50.600 --> 12:51.800
the same heart,

12:51.880 --> 12:54.040
the desire to achieve something great.

12:56.960 --> 12:58.520
She is far luckier than I am.

13:00.600 --> 13:03.920
She has so many genuine friends

13:04.000 --> 13:05.880
willing to help her.

13:07.920 --> 13:09.920
And she is deeply loved by her…

13:10.440 --> 13:11.400
father

13:12.360 --> 13:13.280
and mother.

13:16.440 --> 13:18.160
Why do I have nothing?

13:19.920 --> 13:21.120
She is not like you.

13:22.280 --> 13:23.680
She is sincere and upright,

13:24.280 --> 13:25.880
acting with integrity.

13:34.440 --> 13:36.200
History favors the victor.

13:38.880 --> 13:40.800
If today's success had been mine,

13:42.040 --> 13:43.960
the story would have been written for me.

13:46.680 --> 13:48.040
Niu Wuniang,

13:49.000 --> 13:50.600
unlucky in youth,

13:51.880 --> 13:53.440
enduring humiliation,

13:55.080 --> 13:56.800
yet unmatched in strategy,

13:57.920 --> 13:59.680
decisive and resolute,

14:01.000 --> 14:02.520
ultimately achieving greatness.

14:30.680 --> 14:34.200
They say this celebration
is for my mother's birthday,

14:36.680 --> 14:39.920
but it has never truly been about her.

14:42.800 --> 14:44.400
Her heart has long died,

14:45.760 --> 14:47.200
and she no longer wishes to awaken.

14:50.400 --> 14:51.680
But I am different.

14:52.880 --> 14:54.120
If my heart dies,

14:56.000 --> 14:58.000
you shall all be buried with me!

14:59.800 --> 15:00.680
What are you trying to do?

15:08.560 --> 15:09.560
Dear,

15:10.600 --> 15:13.360
we signed our marriage contract
right here.

15:14.480 --> 15:16.840
You promised to treat me well,

15:17.520 --> 15:19.920
but your heart is only for Ji Yingying.

15:24.880 --> 15:27.120
She refused to marry you,

15:27.760 --> 15:29.920
so why do you torment me,

15:30.000 --> 15:31.600
imprison me?

15:33.000 --> 15:35.080
What did I do wrong?

15:35.600 --> 15:37.880
My heart has always been yours!

15:37.960 --> 15:40.520
We've come to this point,

15:41.400 --> 15:43.000
and yet you're still putting on an act.

15:43.720 --> 15:44.920
What's the point?

16:28.960 --> 16:30.400
Niu Wuniang jumped from the building!

16:31.080 --> 16:31.920
Niu Wuniang!

17:00.840 --> 17:03.400
How did I end up with such a daughter?

17:03.480 --> 17:05.040
She used her own life to set a trap!

17:05.119 --> 17:06.920
She hasn't made any progress
after all these years!

17:07.000 --> 17:09.280
If Zhao Xiuyuan was wronged, then…

17:09.359 --> 17:10.720
He's even more useless!

17:11.240 --> 17:13.000
To be so easily manipulated by a woman,

17:13.079 --> 17:14.760
what great things
could he possibly accomplish?

17:14.839 --> 17:16.040
Then we'll have to…

17:17.119 --> 17:20.280
Wait a little longer.
First, deal with what's at hand.

17:20.359 --> 17:22.560
Once the Zhao family gathers,
we'll send them all off together.

17:22.640 --> 17:25.119
That way, Wuniang
won't be alone on her journey.

17:25.920 --> 17:28.079
Don't say I never cared for her

17:28.160 --> 17:29.360
even as her father.

17:32.160 --> 17:33.800
Zhao Xiuyuan murdered Niu Wuniang

17:33.880 --> 17:35.440
and has been imprisoned
by the Niu family guards.

17:35.960 --> 17:37.040
Now the Zhao family

17:37.120 --> 17:39.640
barely holds together
under Mr. Zhao Senior.

17:41.920 --> 17:44.440
But sacrificing her own life
to drag someone down with her,

17:44.960 --> 17:47.360
that's something
only Niu Wuniang could do.

17:47.440 --> 17:49.280
Are you saying

17:50.120 --> 17:51.840
Zhao Xiuyuan was wronged?

17:53.600 --> 17:55.520
Killing Niu Wuniang at this time

17:55.600 --> 17:57.160
wouldn't benefit him at all.

17:57.240 --> 17:58.440
Why would he do it?

17:58.520 --> 18:01.160
And in broad daylight, no less.

18:01.880 --> 18:03.640
I just can't understand

18:04.400 --> 18:06.640
why Niu Wuniang would go

18:07.160 --> 18:08.520
to such lengths.

18:10.520 --> 18:12.480
If you can't figure it out, don't try.

18:13.480 --> 18:15.640
You're not the same kind of person as her.

18:15.720 --> 18:18.160
You'll never understand her motives.

18:21.280 --> 18:23.960
I've already written
about Jinglan's matter,

18:24.920 --> 18:27.560
asking my family to help mediate.

18:28.800 --> 18:31.360
Father and Jinglin wrote back saying
they will not only mediate the orders,

18:31.440 --> 18:33.120
but also try to find someone in Chang'an

18:33.200 --> 18:34.600
to plead for Jinglan.

18:35.280 --> 18:37.560
The court currently states
this is a suspicious case,

18:37.640 --> 18:39.240
and they want to question Jinglan,

18:39.320 --> 18:40.600
but it doesn't mean he's been convicted.

18:44.440 --> 18:45.680
Thank you, Madam.

18:46.400 --> 18:47.320
Thank you, Mr. Jingshan.

18:49.520 --> 18:51.840
We're all family now.

18:51.920 --> 18:53.320
Do you still need to call me Madam?

18:54.280 --> 18:55.520
Does this mean

18:55.600 --> 18:58.320
you're truly willing to divorce Jinglan?

19:05.120 --> 19:06.120
Mother,

19:06.840 --> 19:09.520
the loss of weavers
is growing worse by the day.

19:09.600 --> 19:11.600
If this continues,

19:12.280 --> 19:13.760
it will have a significant impact

19:13.840 --> 19:15.600
on the brocade industry in Yizhou.

19:15.680 --> 19:17.840
I want to personally go to Mianzhou.

19:18.960 --> 19:19.920
To know the enemy and ourselves

19:20.000 --> 19:21.240
is the only way
to find the right solution.

19:22.080 --> 19:22.960
No.

19:23.040 --> 19:26.360
In this situation, you cannot leave.

19:27.520 --> 19:29.600
Stay in Yizhou City.

19:31.120 --> 19:32.520
As for Mianzhou…

19:34.600 --> 19:35.480
Jingshan will go.

19:37.960 --> 19:40.440
Understood.
I'll get to the bottom of this.

19:41.680 --> 19:43.200
Thank you, Mr. Jingshan.

19:45.120 --> 19:46.480
Jingshan,

19:49.680 --> 19:51.280
as for the others, it's fine to wait.

19:51.360 --> 19:53.800
But as for Master Chen and Master Li,

19:53.880 --> 19:56.400
bring them back immediately
as they requested.

19:57.240 --> 19:59.080
We've taken many orders from Tubo,

19:59.800 --> 20:01.840
and now we need manpower more than ever.

20:03.040 --> 20:03.880
Yes.

20:13.080 --> 20:15.680
Ms. Ji, someone at the door
asked me to give this to you.

20:32.120 --> 20:34.120
Ms. Ji, if it's something you want,

20:34.200 --> 20:35.600
you should take it yourself.

20:37.560 --> 20:40.240
Ms. Ji, if you want something,
it's best you take it yourself.

20:41.040 --> 20:42.040
Let's go!

20:49.240 --> 20:50.720
Whose letter is this?

20:54.320 --> 20:56.960
It's from Mr. Chen,
saying it's the right season.

20:57.040 --> 20:59.440
If we want to dye Shu Red Silk,
we should go harvest the dye now.

21:21.680 --> 21:22.920
- Chen.
- Slow down!

21:23.000 --> 21:23.960
Pin,

21:25.040 --> 21:26.040
why are you wearing…

21:26.120 --> 21:27.600
Aren't those Yingying's clothes?

21:28.280 --> 21:30.880
Why did you suddenly call us
up the mountain to gather dye?

21:30.960 --> 21:31.920
Exactly.

21:32.000 --> 21:33.960
Because Yingying wants to meet someone

21:34.480 --> 21:36.040
who could be in danger.

21:37.280 --> 21:39.000
Yingying is afraid
someone might capture that person

21:39.080 --> 21:41.520
or someone might capture her
to threaten that person.

21:42.360 --> 21:45.080
So, she asked us
to help her with something.

21:45.160 --> 21:47.080
She wants us to distract the enemy.

21:47.160 --> 21:48.680
Distract the enemy?

21:49.200 --> 21:51.160
What enemy? Where are they?

21:51.240 --> 21:52.280
Yingying!

21:56.320 --> 21:57.400
Alright.

21:57.480 --> 22:00.200
I never thought the day would come
when you'd cover my mouth.

22:01.840 --> 22:04.440
The reason Yingying told us about this

22:04.520 --> 22:05.880
is because she trusts us.

22:06.840 --> 22:07.680
Not just that,

22:07.760 --> 22:09.160
I think if anyone asks,

22:09.240 --> 22:10.800
we can explain the Imperial Uncle
is here enjoying himself.

22:10.880 --> 22:12.520
If anyone disturbs his mood,

22:12.600 --> 22:13.600
the Imperial Uncle
certainly won't be polite!

22:13.680 --> 22:16.160
Are you sure your father won't hit you?

22:17.520 --> 22:18.640
He used to hit me.

22:18.720 --> 22:19.840
But not anymore.

22:19.920 --> 22:20.760
He trusts me.

22:20.840 --> 22:22.800
He believes in everything I do.

22:23.480 --> 22:26.480
He trusts
that I know when to use this identity.

22:26.560 --> 22:28.200
Alright, let's go.

22:28.280 --> 22:30.080
- Time to gather the dye.
- Wait a moment.

22:30.720 --> 22:32.120
Let's discuss a plan first.

22:32.640 --> 22:33.760
Come on.

22:35.320 --> 22:37.520
In a moment, half of us will…

22:37.600 --> 22:39.840
This mountain is opened by me!

22:39.920 --> 22:42.280
These trees are planted by me!

22:42.360 --> 22:44.640
If you want to pass,

22:44.720 --> 22:47.520
then we'll break your legs!

22:48.440 --> 22:51.080
That doesn't rhyme at all.
It lacks any vigor.

22:51.160 --> 22:52.720
It doesn't rhyme?

22:53.240 --> 22:54.680
Break…

22:55.200 --> 22:57.520
- Break…
- Break their legs crooked.

22:58.080 --> 22:58.920
That's better.

22:59.000 --> 23:00.560
Stop! Run quickly!

23:00.640 --> 23:02.480
We'll break your legs crooked!

23:06.720 --> 23:09.320
The other half will quietly move forward.

23:09.400 --> 23:11.200
The more we act like this,
the more suspicious it'll make them.

24:40.960 --> 24:42.560
The tree still stands,

24:43.880 --> 24:45.200
but where have the people gone?

24:50.800 --> 24:53.880
HEAVEN AND EARTH BEAR WITNESS
THOUGH WE PART TODAY, I'LL MARRY YOU…

24:55.080 --> 24:56.320
Heaven and earth bear witness.

24:57.600 --> 24:59.000
Though we part today,

24:59.080 --> 25:01.600
I'll marry you in glory someday.

25:02.720 --> 25:04.040
Once sworn allies,

25:04.720 --> 25:06.400
there's always a long road ahead.

25:10.560 --> 25:11.640
Yang Jinglan,

25:12.240 --> 25:13.400
I saw it.

25:21.960 --> 25:23.160
In my heart,

25:23.680 --> 25:25.640
I will always be your wife.

25:27.560 --> 25:29.520
I only wish for your safe return.

25:31.200 --> 25:32.440
If you're here,

25:33.040 --> 25:34.520
then look at me closely.

25:47.080 --> 25:49.280
I'm safe and well now.

25:49.800 --> 25:51.200
No need for you to worry.

25:52.280 --> 25:54.200
You must take care of yourself.

26:19.160 --> 26:20.000
Don't go over there.

26:21.480 --> 26:23.240
There are people
to the southeast and northwest.

26:24.440 --> 26:25.720
If you go now,

26:26.480 --> 26:28.480
leaving aside
whether you can escape unharmed,

26:29.040 --> 26:30.720
your relationship with her

26:31.560 --> 26:32.720
will become even harder to explain.

26:35.200 --> 26:36.480
That divorce letter…

26:37.560 --> 26:38.600
will have been written in vain.

27:18.760 --> 27:20.360
A lock of black hair as my pledge.

27:20.880 --> 27:22.160
Yang Jinglan,

27:22.680 --> 27:24.400
I'll wait for you to return and marry me.

28:53.920 --> 28:55.480
Where is Yang Jinglan?

28:56.000 --> 28:57.360
As you expected,

28:57.440 --> 28:59.240
Yang Jinglan
deliberately appeared in Yizhou City

28:59.320 --> 29:01.440
to draw our forces away from the city.

29:02.080 --> 29:03.160
After he left,

29:03.240 --> 29:06.160
his associate from the martial world
showed up near the Brocade Bureau.

29:06.680 --> 29:09.320
That person must be the one
who took the item.

29:09.400 --> 29:11.080
I asked where he is!

29:12.400 --> 29:13.440
Our people are still pursuing him.

29:13.520 --> 29:15.000
What about his friend?

29:15.080 --> 29:16.400
Also being pursued.

29:17.000 --> 29:19.560
But their escape route
is already under our control.

29:19.640 --> 29:20.800
They won't get away.

29:20.880 --> 29:23.880
I have been killing
and conquering my whole life,

29:24.400 --> 29:27.320
and yet I've raised
a bunch of useless fools like you!

29:27.400 --> 29:28.920
Within three days,

29:29.000 --> 29:30.520
I either want the item in my hands

29:30.600 --> 29:32.200
or their heads!

29:32.280 --> 29:33.920
Niu Jin deceived Your Excellency,

29:34.000 --> 29:36.320
secretly colluding with Nanzhao
to smuggle tribute brocade.

29:36.920 --> 29:38.600
He's been in secret contact
with Qingping Officer of Nanzhao

29:38.680 --> 29:40.920
and Sheng Fengze,
the Prince Bai of Nanzhao.

29:41.000 --> 29:44.200
The evidence is all here.

29:48.040 --> 29:49.320
I ask Your Excellency
to investigate thoroughly!

29:51.520 --> 29:53.440
WRITTEN CONFESSION; NIU

29:53.520 --> 29:56.000
IS THE STATEMENT TRUE?
IT IS ALL THE TRUTH, I DARE NOT LIE

29:56.080 --> 29:57.400
NIU

30:04.120 --> 30:05.200
Yingying!

30:05.960 --> 30:07.760
- Yingying!
- Jingshan.

30:08.320 --> 30:10.320
How is it? Was there any issue
with the brocade workshop in Mianzhou?

30:11.120 --> 30:13.240
The brocade workshop in Mianzhou
is completely abandoned.

30:19.200 --> 30:21.080
Don't rush. Take your time explaining.

30:21.840 --> 30:22.680
What happened?

30:23.400 --> 30:25.960
When I arrived in Mianzhou,
I learned that recently,

30:26.040 --> 30:26.880
all the craftsmen stayed

30:26.960 --> 30:29.520
in the brocade workshop
to speed up production.

30:29.600 --> 30:32.160
At first,
neighbors could hear some activity,

30:32.240 --> 30:33.360
but gradually,

30:33.440 --> 30:35.200
they rarely saw anyone coming or going.

30:35.720 --> 30:36.640
Then, one day,

30:36.720 --> 30:38.400
everyone disappeared.

30:38.480 --> 30:40.720
The once vast brocade workshop
was left completely empty,

30:40.800 --> 30:42.680
no looms, no weavers.

30:43.640 --> 30:45.720
Based on the size of the brocade workshop,

30:45.800 --> 30:47.600
I estimated that
the number of craftsmen it could house

30:47.680 --> 30:49.440
is far less than the current number

30:49.520 --> 30:51.080
of missing craftsmen in Yizhou.

30:52.640 --> 30:54.080
So, this means,

30:54.960 --> 30:57.320
the brocade workshop in Mianzhou
is just a diversion.

30:57.840 --> 31:00.280
Those craftsmen were likely kidnapped,

31:00.360 --> 31:03.600
perhaps even taken while still in Yizhou.

31:06.880 --> 31:09.480
They created the illusion that they went
to the brocade workshop in Mianzhou,

31:09.560 --> 31:11.520
thus evading government investigation.

31:12.960 --> 31:14.200
Do you remember

31:14.280 --> 31:16.720
the illegal brocade workshop
Niu Wuniang had in the mountains?

31:17.320 --> 31:18.400
Do you think

31:18.480 --> 31:19.520
the Niu family is behind this?

31:19.600 --> 31:20.520
No.

31:21.080 --> 31:22.880
Niu Jin wouldn't repeat the same mistake.

31:24.760 --> 31:25.920
But I'm thinking of someone else…

31:27.400 --> 31:29.480
Someone who spent lavishly,
to build a reputation,

31:29.560 --> 31:30.840
bought off the Yu family,
and attempted to win over me,

31:30.920 --> 31:32.960
the Zhao family, and Yang Juli,

31:33.040 --> 31:33.960
and stole patterns.

31:34.040 --> 31:35.400
Such ambition…

31:36.080 --> 31:39.000
There's no one else I can think of.

31:41.360 --> 31:42.840
Sheng Fengze,

31:42.920 --> 31:44.000
the Prince Bai of Nanzhao.

31:45.560 --> 31:47.320
Sheng Fengze…

31:51.280 --> 31:52.360
What should we do?

31:52.440 --> 31:54.600
Let me gather the family members
and hold a meeting to discuss it.

31:54.680 --> 31:55.640
No.

31:56.160 --> 31:58.040
This isn't just a Yang family matter.

31:58.800 --> 32:00.640
This concerns
the entire Shu brocade industry.

32:03.560 --> 32:05.000
I need to see someone first.

33:20.720 --> 33:21.560
Rumors outside say

33:21.640 --> 33:23.800
that Niu Wuniang's death
was a misunderstanding.

33:24.320 --> 33:25.960
You're still the head of the Zhao family.

33:28.680 --> 33:30.400
Of course,
I'm the head of the Zhao family.

33:31.800 --> 33:32.760
General Niu

33:33.280 --> 33:35.440
just wanted someone
to oversee the brocade business.

33:36.240 --> 33:38.880
But as for who that person is
and how they oversee it,

33:38.960 --> 33:40.280
he doesn't care,

33:42.000 --> 33:43.120
even if they're leashed

33:43.640 --> 33:45.000
like a dog.

33:45.760 --> 33:47.560
But General Niu doesn't understand me.

33:49.600 --> 33:51.920
From the moment I married Niu Wuniang,

33:52.680 --> 33:54.040
reputation and dignity

33:55.040 --> 33:56.720
no longer mattered to me.

34:02.320 --> 34:03.520
What do you want from me?

34:06.120 --> 34:08.679
A few days ago, the brocade workshop
in Mianzhou heavily recruited workers,

34:09.199 --> 34:11.320
but recently,
it's suddenly been abandoned,

34:11.400 --> 34:13.600
and the weavers have also disappeared.

34:14.520 --> 34:16.400
I suspect this is Bai Sheng's scheme.

34:18.600 --> 34:20.960
I hope the brocade merchants
can set aside their past grudges,

34:21.040 --> 34:22.360
unite together,

34:22.440 --> 34:23.880
and discuss a countermeasure.

34:29.080 --> 34:30.960
But looking at my current state,

34:32.360 --> 34:33.600
what can I possibly do?

34:42.360 --> 34:44.800
How I wish to return to those days
when we flew kites together.

34:44.880 --> 34:46.400
Brocade Master Zhao,

34:46.480 --> 34:47.679
head of the Zhao family,

34:49.760 --> 34:52.960
I came today because the Zhao family
is a leading household.

34:53.040 --> 34:54.560
The craftsmen of the Zhao family

34:54.639 --> 34:56.880
are also part
of Yizhou's brocade industry.

34:58.560 --> 35:00.720
This concerns the survival
of the entire brocade trade.

35:01.440 --> 35:02.840
One suffers,

35:03.360 --> 35:04.680
all suffer.

35:06.080 --> 35:08.080
You were once
the president of the Bloom Society.

35:09.280 --> 35:10.760
Now you're the steward of the Yang family

35:11.520 --> 35:12.800
and an ally of the Yu family.

35:13.520 --> 35:16.760
If the Zhao family lends you a hand,

35:18.320 --> 35:20.160
the three major families
of the brocade industry

35:20.760 --> 35:22.640
will stand by your side.

35:23.560 --> 35:25.400
Even without me as the Brocade Master,

35:26.360 --> 35:28.440
the future brocade trade in Yizhou

35:29.280 --> 35:31.200
will be under your control.

35:33.720 --> 35:35.320
When do you plan to gather them?

35:35.400 --> 35:36.680
The sooner, the better.

35:37.200 --> 35:38.160
Tomorrow would be best.

35:39.920 --> 35:40.760
Alright.

35:42.080 --> 35:43.360
The Zhao family will be there for sure.

35:45.400 --> 35:47.240
On behalf of the brocade merchants
in Yizhou,

35:47.320 --> 35:48.400
thank you, Mr. Zhao.

36:04.920 --> 36:07.360
Since fate won't let us journey together,

36:07.440 --> 36:09.560
let me help you soar
to the highest heights.

36:10.280 --> 36:13.960
That way,
I can still see you when I look up.

36:17.720 --> 36:19.040
Call for my grandfather.

36:19.960 --> 36:21.040
There's an important matter to discuss.

36:32.680 --> 36:34.160
General Niu said before

36:35.120 --> 36:36.400
that when it comes to the brocade trade,

36:37.080 --> 36:38.520
I'm the one in charge!

36:47.960 --> 36:50.040
How many craftsmen have arrived
in Nanzhao?

36:52.760 --> 36:55.600
Four hundred and eight
have already arrived in Nanzhao.

36:55.680 --> 36:58.080
Another 125 are still on the way.

36:58.160 --> 37:00.160
Thirteen refused to yield
and would rather die.

37:01.520 --> 37:02.480
To prevent them
from taking their own lives,

37:02.560 --> 37:03.400
they have not yet departed.

37:04.840 --> 37:06.360
According to Your Highness's standards,

37:06.880 --> 37:09.360
there are 75 first-class craftsmen,

37:09.440 --> 37:11.520
and the rest are second-class craftsmen.

37:12.480 --> 37:14.000
That's enough.

37:14.520 --> 37:15.800
Yang Jinglan
and the officials of the Troop Six

37:15.880 --> 37:17.520
are searching everywhere
for news about you.

37:18.760 --> 37:20.240
Why not return earlier?

37:21.800 --> 37:22.760
Today,

37:22.840 --> 37:24.680
Niu Jin rejected your offer
to collaborate again.

37:26.400 --> 37:28.880
He'll agree eventually. No rush.

37:30.480 --> 37:32.440
For now, let's borrow his base

37:32.520 --> 37:33.760
to recover.

37:41.120 --> 37:42.240
Now that the Prince Bai has also arrived,

37:42.760 --> 37:43.800
what should we do?

37:45.560 --> 37:47.040
They're already here.

37:47.120 --> 37:48.600
Let's meet them.

38:00.240 --> 38:01.240
The Zhao family

38:01.320 --> 38:02.600
might not show up.

38:02.680 --> 38:03.920
How about

38:04.440 --> 38:05.720
we start first?

38:13.320 --> 38:14.560
Sirs,

38:15.480 --> 38:18.000
Governor Zhang is investigating
the missing craftsmen.

38:19.240 --> 38:20.160
But even now,

38:20.240 --> 38:22.520
craftsmen continue to disappear
in the city.

38:24.040 --> 38:25.240
The government is understaffed

38:25.320 --> 38:26.760
to handle everything.

38:27.520 --> 38:28.400
So,

38:28.920 --> 38:30.920
it requires mutual assistance among us

38:31.000 --> 38:32.680
to overcome this difficulty.

38:33.840 --> 38:35.880
Since you took the lead

38:36.400 --> 38:38.440
and called us together,

38:39.200 --> 38:40.360
you must

38:41.400 --> 38:43.600
have a plan, right?

38:46.160 --> 38:48.720
I suggest that in the coming days,

38:48.800 --> 38:50.840
we gather all the weavers together.

38:50.920 --> 38:52.960
Keep them
in each household's brocade workshop.

38:53.040 --> 38:54.000
No one is allowed to leave.

38:54.600 --> 38:55.880
Governor Zhang has also agreed

38:55.960 --> 38:58.240
to assign soldiers
to guard each household.

38:59.440 --> 39:01.320
By gathering the weavers together,

39:01.840 --> 39:03.320
and with the protection of the government,

39:03.400 --> 39:04.920
the wrongdoers

39:05.000 --> 39:06.520
won't dare to act recklessly.

39:10.680 --> 39:12.560
That's a good idea,

39:16.040 --> 39:17.440
but what about business?

39:18.040 --> 39:20.120
Collecting silk, buying materials,

39:20.200 --> 39:22.400
trading, transporting goods…

39:22.920 --> 39:25.720
These still require people to go out.

39:26.480 --> 39:28.120
Mr. Yu has a point.

39:28.200 --> 39:29.200
Other than that,

39:29.280 --> 39:31.080
if we forbid weavers from leaving,

39:31.160 --> 39:32.320
that will mean

39:32.400 --> 39:34.520
we're responsible
for all their necessities.

39:35.040 --> 39:36.280
That costs money.

39:36.360 --> 39:38.040
Regarding purchases,

39:38.120 --> 39:40.400
I propose selecting personnel
from each household

39:40.480 --> 39:42.360
to form a unified team.

39:42.440 --> 39:43.880
Under government protection,

39:43.960 --> 39:45.640
they will handle the buying and selling.

39:47.160 --> 39:49.840
As for the money spent on this matter,

39:50.840 --> 39:52.360
I truly have no solution.

39:59.280 --> 40:00.480
But we spend money

40:00.560 --> 40:03.760
on silk, on patterns…

40:04.280 --> 40:07.280
Why can't we spend a bit on people?

40:08.040 --> 40:09.800
With craftsmen,

40:09.880 --> 40:11.920
we can have true Shu brocade.

40:17.680 --> 40:20.040
In this time of crisis,

40:20.120 --> 40:21.560
only by joining hands

40:21.640 --> 40:22.880
and working together

40:23.400 --> 40:25.040
can we overcome this challenge.

40:27.160 --> 40:28.920
The Yang family will lead by example.

40:32.280 --> 40:35.600
The Yu family is willing
to follow Ms. Ji's arrangements.

40:35.680 --> 40:38.640
The Zhao family is willing
to follow Ms. Ji's arrangements.

40:42.320 --> 40:43.360
Mr. Zhao Senior.

40:45.760 --> 40:48.400
Let's set aside other grievances for now.

40:49.040 --> 40:50.720
On this matter,

40:50.800 --> 40:51.760
the Zhao family

40:52.280 --> 40:55.240
is united with all of you.

40:58.600 --> 41:02.120
We are willing
to follow Mr. Ji's arrangements.

41:02.760 --> 41:04.280
Thank you, sirs.

41:08.360 --> 41:09.520
Thank you, General Xue.

41:12.160 --> 41:13.280
Apologies,

41:13.360 --> 41:14.360
I'm late.

41:14.440 --> 41:16.480
No, you arrived at just the right time.

41:18.960 --> 41:19.840
Zhuge,

41:19.920 --> 41:21.320
why don't you come with us?

41:21.400 --> 41:23.000
The Brocade Bureau
cannot be left unattended.

41:23.080 --> 41:24.040
We agreed,

41:24.120 --> 41:25.720
you handle the living,
and I'll handle the dead.

41:26.560 --> 41:27.480
Alright,

41:27.560 --> 41:29.240
but make sure you stay safe.

41:29.320 --> 41:30.440
You still need to stay alive

41:30.520 --> 41:32.080
to take the imperial exam in Chang'an.

41:32.160 --> 41:33.360
By then, Gao and I

41:33.440 --> 41:35.200
will be counting on you,
Zhuge the Top Scholar,

41:35.280 --> 41:36.280
to take care of us.

41:37.280 --> 41:38.640
If you're really found guilty,

41:38.720 --> 41:40.360
it'll stain my life forever,

41:40.880 --> 41:42.640
and I won't be able
to become a Top Scholar.

41:43.640 --> 41:44.800
Got it.

41:44.880 --> 41:47.200
I'll return with a clean record.

41:48.240 --> 41:49.680
And safe and sound.

41:50.280 --> 41:52.640
Understood.
You're still as nagging as ever.

41:52.720 --> 41:54.400
General Xue, let's go! Let's go.

41:54.480 --> 41:55.560
- Move out!
- We're leaving.

41:58.160 --> 41:59.400
The road ahead is uncertain.

42:01.680 --> 42:02.520
Take care.

42:08.600 --> 42:10.960
Perhaps the story can go like this…

42:11.040 --> 42:13.480
Yang Jinglan attempts
to assassinate the Prince Bai,

42:14.000 --> 42:15.240
causing outrage in Nanzhao.

42:15.760 --> 42:17.320
They raid Yizhou City

42:17.400 --> 42:18.840
to demand justice.

42:18.920 --> 42:20.080
And General Niu,

42:20.160 --> 42:21.680
rushing to Yizhou's aid,

42:22.680 --> 42:25.160
defeats Nanzhao's attack,

42:25.240 --> 42:26.680
protects the people,

42:27.480 --> 42:28.320
and

42:28.400 --> 42:31.360
persuades Nanzhao
to maintain good relations with Tang.

42:31.880 --> 42:33.560
Such a major achievement,

42:33.640 --> 42:35.360
who would dare question you?

42:35.440 --> 42:37.960
Not even the Military Commissioner would.

42:39.320 --> 42:43.400
As for your previous minor mistakes…

42:43.480 --> 42:44.520
Well,

42:45.040 --> 42:46.000
they'll be a drop in the ocean.

42:53.800 --> 42:55.240
Your suggestion

42:55.320 --> 42:57.360
is to have my soldiers disguise themselves
as Nanzhao troops

42:57.440 --> 42:58.920
and then fight each other?

43:01.120 --> 43:03.240
I'm merely a leisure-loving prince

43:03.320 --> 43:04.840
without troops.

43:06.000 --> 43:07.600
So, I'd rather hope

43:07.680 --> 43:10.200
you can be self-sufficient

43:10.280 --> 43:11.480
and rely on your own efforts.

43:13.800 --> 43:15.640
What exactly do you want?
